      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Las posiciones son explícitas en el payload, como en PlantUML o Structurizr: el diagrama es un mapa del sistema, no un grafo que el motor acomoda.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<is-component-diagram open-on-click>\n  <script type=\"application/json\">\n    {\n      \"componentDiagram\": {\n        \"title\": \"Servicio de voz\",\n        \"packages\": [\n          { \"id\": \"pkg-api\", \"label\": \"API\", \"x\": 20, \"y\": 60, \"w\": 300, \"h\": 190 }\n        ],\n        \"components\": [\n          { \"id\": \"gw\", \"label\": \"Gateway\", \"stereotype\": \"worker\", \"x\": 40, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 120, \"h\": 54 },\n          { \"id\": \"sess\", \"label\": \"Sesion\", \"stereotype\": \"module\", \"x\": 190, \"y\": 100, \"w\": 110, \"h\": 54 },\n          { \"id\": \"db\", \"label\": \"D1\", \"stereotype\": \"db\", \"x\": 190, \"y\": 180, \"w\": 110, \"h\": 46 }\n        ],\n        \"links\": [\n          { \"from\": \"gw\", \"to\": \"sess\" },\n          { \"from\": \"sess\", \"to\": \"db\" }\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</is-component-diagram>"
